For those who do not know yet.

There is a live Lojban chat where you can practice Lojban and get answers
to your questions.

There are several methods of joining it, the chat is spread across several
networks.
You may select just one way to join it, the way most suitable to you.


*Via Telegram messenger* (only if you have a mobile phone with Telegram
installed there):
1. Main Lojban chat - https://t.me/joinchat/BLVsYz3hCF8mCAb6fzW1Rw
2. Chat for asking beginners' questions  -
https://telegram.me/joinchat/BLVsYz4hC9ulWahupDLovA
3. Chat in Lojban only - https://telegram.me/joinchat/BLVsYz20Boixl0xN-0TrPw

*Via Slack:messenger* (no phone number is required):
https://slaka.herokuapp.com

*Via Discord messenger* (voice chats might happen there in the months to
come):
https://discord.gg/c8weYzf

